d new indicators and improved tutorials to make the opening sequence easier to follow and less overwhelming.Increased visibility in the Shrouded World.Increased the range of the light buff gained from Transcendent Blossoms.The light now ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:10:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036563","verified_at":"2026-10-23T17:26:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3557360-1846651706695779","game_id":"steam-3557360","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Second Stone Demo as part of Steam Next Fest!🔥","summary":"Greeting, friends! We are so excited to finally share the Second Stone demo with you all. If you didn’t get a chance to check it out during the playtest period or at gamescom in August, now is your chance!The demo includes 20-40 minutes of the game and introduces you to the mechanics of Manastone upgrades for weapons and spells, the core mystery of Second Stone's story surrounding its dual worlds, and the variety of combat styles and mechanics.Have fun with the demo and talk to you again soon, M","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T15:41:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695779","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:28:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3557360-1846018067925839","game_id":"steam-3557360","kind":"announcement","title":"The Closed Second Stone Playtest is live now - join us!","summary":"Greetings, hunters!We are back with an amazing surprise! For all of those among you who sadly couldn’t visit us at gamescom 2026, you have a second chance to dive into the beautiful yet dangerous worlds of Second Stone. Right now, you can sign up for our Closed Playtest that will end October 18.The playtest covers 20-30 minutes of early parts of the full game, so you can follow Shiren on his first mission as a treasure hunter and dungeon diver. You will also learn about all the intricate systems","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T11:37:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925839","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3557360-1841579228671687","game_id":"steam-3557360","kind":"announcement","title":"Play Second Stone at gamescom in Cologne!","summary":"Greetings, friends!It's summer, it's August, which means it's that wonderful time of year again: gamescom is just around the corner! The biggest games event in the world kicks off with the gamescom Opening Night Live next Tuesday and opens its gates in Cologne on Wednesday.And the best thing about that? It means you can try out Second Stone at gamescom in around three days! Step into the boots of Shiren, a young treasure hunter who can cross between the vibrant Light World and its sinister mirro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T16:00:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671687","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3557360-1830163047258372","game_id":"steam-3557360","kind":"announcement","title":"Skyward and Headup join forces to bring Second Stone to life!","summary":"Greetings, hunters!We just shared some big news at today’s Galaxies Spring Showcase: Skyward Entertainment is teaming up with Headup as our publishing partner! 🤝Together, we’ll be working hard to bring our precious gem out into the realm of Action RPGs: Second Stone!To celebrate our collaboration, we prepared an awesome new trailer for you. In case you didn’t catch the Galaxies Spring Showcase live, you can check out the trailer right here:Second Stone is a narrative-driven Action RPG set within","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-16T19:21:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047258372","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3557360-1830163047254920","game_id":"steam-3557360","kind":"announcement","title":"Galaxies Spring Showcase: Second Stone is part of the show! 🪐","summary":"Save the date, friends!We’re excited to announce that Second Stone is part of the Galaxies Spring Showcase! 🌌Join us live on April 16th, 8:00 PM UK / 9:00 PM CEST / 12:00 PM PACIFIC for the showcase over at or for some awesome news!It’s going to be an amazing event with a stellar lineup. You surely don’t want to miss that, so mark your calendars and get ready to jump on that Hype Train!See you at the Galaxies Spring Showcase streams tomorrow! 🚀 The Skyward Team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-15T13:37:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047254920","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3557360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3557360":"2026-10-26T10:39:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3557360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:16Z"},"5213480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10